cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "fable-engine: a framework-free engine for interactive narratives with offline export and algorithmic-structure summary"
abstract: >-
  A tiny, dependency-free TypeScript engine for interactive branching narratives.
  It plays stories in a Canvas 2D player, exports each story as a single self-contained
  offline HTML file (file over app), and deterministically summarizes the algorithmic
  structure of each narrative (scenes, variables, branches, modifiers) as evidence for
  interpreting computational thinking. Developed within the RemidiAção platform
  (PPGIE/UFRGS) to operationalize the remediation of written texts into interactive digital
  narratives.
type: software
version: 1.0.0
